From: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:49:54 -0400
Subject: [M157] D3D11: Reject mixed 3D/non-3D and overlapping layers

Reject framebuffers mixing 3D and non-3D attachments on D3D11 and
overlapping texture layer ranges in colorAttachmentsAreUniqueImages so
OMSetRenderTargets never silently fails and leaves stale render targets
bound. (this requires
https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/chromium/src/+/8611537)

(cherry picked from commit b64f67868464507ee62605c5a9108f68083e35ad)

Test: angle_end2end_tests --gtest_filter="FramebufferTest_ES3.Mixed3D*:WebGL2CompatibilityTest.UniqueFramebufferAttachments*:HardenedContextTest.UniqueFramebufferAttachments*"
Bug: b/574035865
